BranchLink Enterprise Network:
Overview-
BranchLink Enterprise Network is a Cisco Packet Tracer project that demonstrates communication between Headquarters (HQ), Branch-A, and Branch-B using OSPF dynamic routing. The network allows branch users to communicate with HQ devices and access centralized server resources.

Network Topology:

HQ Router
Branch-A Router
Branch-B Router
HR Team PC
Finance Team PC
Sales Team PC
Support Team PC
Centralized Server
Cisco Switches
Cloud and DSL WAN Connectivity

